      "writtenOn": "2025-08-05T18:22:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`alloc_task_dmabuf_record` can return null, but that should not be possible here.\n\nThe `dmabuf_info-\u003elock` is taken on 418 and is still held here. No new entries can be added to `dmabuf_info-\u003edmabufs` without that lock. We check to make sure the number of records we preallocated before the lock is still sufficient with the lock held on 419. So only if `dmabuf_count` is incorrect should this fail.",
